[00:01.74]Ah, fleeting memories
{"啊，转瞬即逝的回忆"}
[00:03.75]Where did the days go?
{"那些日子都去了哪里？"}
[00:09.56]Time spent catching butterflies
{"曾经追逐蝴蝶的时光"}
[00:11.07]And watching rainbows
{"还有仰望彩虹的往昔"}
[00:16.78]Ah, little memories
{"啊，细碎的记忆"}
[00:18.94]Things aren't the same now
{"如今一切都变了模样"}
[00:24.44]Used to count hot air balloons
{"曾数着飘过的热气球"}
[00:26.37]And paint picture s in the clouds
{"在云朵上描绘幻想"}
[00:31.95]Stuck in the present
{"困在当下"}
[00:33.83]But the present's on repeat
{"当下却不断循环"}
[00:39.49]Shards of broken glass are poking at my feet
{"碎玻璃碴刺痛我的脚掌"}
[00:48.78]Please take me to the past
{"请带我回到过去"}
[00:54.38]All I want is for those memories to last
{"我只愿那些回忆永不消逝"}
[02:32.02]Sweet, childish memories
{"甜蜜的童真记忆"}
[02:33.51]I miss your toothless smile
{"想念你缺牙的笑容"}
[02:39.02]Place our teeth beneath the pillows
{"把牙齿藏在枕头底下"}
[02:41.38]Pretend to sleep for a while
{"假装入睡片刻时光"}
[02:46.95]Innocent memories
{"纯真的记忆"}
[02:48.73]Everything is tainted now
{"如今全被玷污"}
[02:54.19]used to sing songs to ghosts
{"曾对幽灵哼唱的歌谣"}
[02:56.38]But now I've forgotten how
{"现在却已遗忘曲调"}
[03:01.88]The black clouds grow
{"乌云渐浓"}
[03:05.33]The truth begins to show
{"真相开始显露"}
[03:08.84]Nothing remains
{"什么都不剩"}
[03:12.60]Dissolved by the rain
{"被雨水溶解殆尽"}
[03:16.52]Remember those times  of happiness
{"铭记那些幸福的时光"}
[03:23.90]Forgotten and lost
{"被遗忘与遗失"}
[03:28.40]I stand here alone
{"我独自伫立于此"}
[04:47.12]Once was light now
{"昔日的光明如今"}
[04:50.82]became remnants of
{"化作零星"}
[04:54.52]Hope and love
{"希望与爱"}
[04:57.68]thrive within our memories
{"在回忆中生生不息"}
